fterwards and that is the  donut hole in all this you said it no  matter how many tests the nfl gives its  players look at what happened with the  tennessee titans  positive tests for six days  after the first positive showed up that  is what the nfl is going to battle all  season  and peter the nfl's approach is  to assume that there will be people who  test positive who get into the building  but to do everything they can to limit  the chance of it spreading once they're  in  i think the better approach would be  put everyone in a hotel the patriots  have that hotel right next to the  stadium they're making it available to  players there aren't many players who  are staying there put everybody in the  hotel then you minimize the chance of  anyone becoming positive because i just  think it's inevitable if a guy gets in  who's positive someone else some way  somehow is going to get it we saw it in  tennessee we're going to see it  somewhere else and until they put all  teams in hotels that that reality is  going to hover over the entire season  and threaten to leave us with fewer than  256 games  i think you're right mike but i also  think that  if you tell 2  460  people you know the nfl players plus  uh you know another  750  coaches and essential staff  hey by the way for the next three months  you can't see your family i do  understand the alternative and the  alternative is  you may lose game checks you may not get  paid i get it  but i think now that only one team has  become the miami marlins which is the  titans uh my feeling is that there's  very little juice right now to send  teams to a hotel  well it worked for the nba in one  location it worked for the nhl in two  locations it would work for the nfl i  believe if they do it i feel like  they're going to wait for the house to  be further on fire than it currently is  but as of last tuesday morning it wasn't  on fire at all when you think about  what's happened over the course of the  last week it shows you how quickly the  virus can take over that's the challenge  for the nfl he's peter king i'm mike  florio we'll see you for more pft on  yahoo videos later in the season  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

